# NOT engine-strict. It was tried and reverted, for a measured reason:
#
#   jsdom 30's transitive dependency @asamuzakjp/css-color@7.1.9 declares `node ^22.22.2 || ^24.15.0 || >=26`,
#   so engine-strict makes `npm ci` REFUSE Node 22.22.0 - a version that was tested and passes 381/381. A
#   declared range stricter than the behaviour is common, and enforcing it blocks working setups.
#
# What actually breaks is a missing `zlib.createZstdDecompress` (added in Node 22.19), so that is checked
# directly by scripts/preflight.mjs, which runs before the tests and says so in one line.
